  "curriculum": "TER arts. 2.1, 3.1–3.5: 60 EC first year and 60 EC compulsory upper-year major, then 15 EC chosen from the approved Psychology differentiation list, 15 EC Bachelor Thesis and a 30 EC University or Personal Minor (30 or 2 × 15 EC). The restricted choice and minor remain unfilled. Do not substitute old-cohort transitional courses. Cognitive Psychology belongs to year 1 even though its course code begins PSBE2.",
  "progression": {
