    "statisticsIII": "Pass Statistics IA and IB and meet Statistics II practical requirements.",
    "thesis": "Pass all first-year courses, Test Theory, Research Methods: Theory and Ethics, Research Practicum, and at least one of Statistics II or Statistics III.",
